          <div class="s2-layout">
            <!-- LEFT: copy -->
            <div class="s2-copy">
              <p class="kicker">What I questioned</p>
              <p class="s2-bold">
                Why should an intelligent product keep asking me to act as its memory?
              </p>
              <p class="s2-body">
                If I already told a friend I went to Ibiza, I expect the next useful question
                to be &ldquo;who did you go with?&rdquo;, not &ldquo;where did you travel?&rdquo;
              </p>
            </div>

