                <article class="slide" data-slide="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="s3-layout">
            <div class="s3-copy">
              <p class="kicker">What I realized</p>
              <p class="s3-bold">
                The bottleneck was not simply model intelligence. It was trust.
              </p>
              <p class="s2-body">
              I needed to know that when the AI interrupted me, it had already checked the information I had given it and genuinely needed something only I could decide.
              </p>
            </div>

