        <article class="slide" data-slide="3" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="s4-layout">
            <div class="s4-copy">
              <p class="kicker">The product decision</p>
              <p class="s4-bold">Make context part of the product, not something hidden inside a markdown.</p>
              <p class="s4-body">The person should provide meaning and judgment, while the product carries the surrounding context: decisions, files, previous work, accepted results, and ongoing tasks. These contexts should each live in stable places the system can inspect and the human can audit.</p>
            </div>
            
